Subject: [PATCH 1/2] drm/v3d: preserve zero-timeout WAIT_BO polling

Semantic backport of upstream 226666556a9b3b51f04f9dad83662e5b9c78a325.
Base: Raspberry Pi linux cff533aec2fa601846766b32ff57204e0a61bed7.
Keep positive timeout conversion and all error/accounting paths unchanged.
The shared-helper migration and unrelated overflow change are not backported.
Apply only after checking the pinned preimage hashes, with --unidiff-zero.
This is a review candidate, not a vendor-approved or installed kernel.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/v3d/v3d_bo.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/v3d/v3d_bo.c
@@ -283,2 +283,2 @@
-	unsigned long timeout_jiffies =
-		nsecs_to_jiffies_timeout(args->timeout_ns);
+	unsigned long timeout_jiffies = args->timeout_ns ?
+		nsecs_to_jiffies_timeout(args->timeout_ns) : 0;
